                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.00/673a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Culbertson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-08-01T12:00:00-04:00">August 1,
                    1931—noon</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>32. Your 84, July 28, 11 a.m. When will elections be called as provided in
                    Article 66 of the Constitution?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
